    "description": {
      "value": "This elegant silver band often resembles curling fig leaves and fits around your brow. You gain a +2 item bonus to Deception and Diplomacy checks.\n\nWhen you invest the circlet, you either increase your Charisma score by 2 or increase it to 18, whichever would give you a higher score.\n\nActivate (2 Actions)\nFrequency: once per hour\nYou cast a 4th-level charm spell (DC 38)."
